		<string text=""/>
		<string text="OFF: buttons act as labeled. IN GAME: Xbox\npositions in play. EVERYWHERE: menus too."/>
		<string text="The pictures of your pad's buttons in menus.\nAUTO follows the pad you use."/>
		<string text="MODERN: a smoother stick curve, and the turn\nspeeds up with the stick held all the way."/>
		<string text="With MODERN: how fast the turn speeds up while\nthe stick is held all the way."/>
		<string text="With MODERN: how fast you look up and down.\nSAME uses your look sensitivity."/>
		<string text="With MODERN: the look stick's round dead zone.\nSAME follows the right stick dead zone."/>
		<string text="With GAME OPTIONS' ZOOM on BOTH: how long a\npress counts as a hold."/>
